    "title": "North Platte Catholic Community Food Pantry Receives $5,000 Grant for Commercial Freezer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago The North Platte Catholic Community Food Pantry is getting some additional freezer space thanks to a $5,000 grant from Farm Credit Services of America. The grant, provided through FCSAmerica’s Working Here Fund, helped the pantry purchase a commercial reach-in freezer. The additional space will allow the pantry to accept and purchase larger quantities of frozen foods, including meat and other nutritious items, while maintaining proper food-safety standards. Read full article",
